of history!

912
00:56:56,916 --> 00:56:57,750
Oh…

913
00:56:57,833 --> 00:57:02,500
Today will be remembered as the day
when writers cast aside their egos

914
00:57:02,583 --> 00:57:03,791
to preserve the

915
00:57:03,875 --> 00:57:05,041
Topus Terrentus.

