No…

920
00:57:12,958 --> 00:57:15,958
We… agreed he would ask you for your book
giving me the opportunity to improve

921
00:57:16,041 --> 00:57:17,000
-your stories.
-Uh…

922
00:57:18,875 --> 00:57:21,166
-That's not what…
-What a plan! He's a genius strategist

923
