if only she could stay one more day
in this realm.

952
00:59:04,458 --> 00:59:05,833
It's too late for that.

953
00:59:05,916 --> 00:59:06,875
No, it's not.

954
00:59:06,958 --> 00:59:12,083
If we send your friend a petty, trivial,
insignificant nightmare tonight

