unburdens her thoughts.

984
01:01:27,208 --> 01:01:28,041
Agh!

985
01:01:33,833 --> 01:01:37,500
Francisca always woke up right before the
sunrise

986
01:01:37,583 --> 01:01:41,208
so she could make breakfast for her ten
older siblings,

987
01:01:41,708 --> 01:01:42,750
all of them men,

988
01:01:43,375 --> 01:01:45,416
they used to work in the silver mines

989
01:01:45,500 --> 01:01:46,916
along with their father

990
01:01:47,000 --> 01:01:48,583
who was the owner.

991
01:01:49,208 --> 01:01:50,833
As nighttime was not enough,

992
01:01:51,333 --> 01:01:53,750
she used any opportunity she had to…

993
01:01:56,291 --> 01:01:57,125
Hmm…

994
01:02:00,541 --> 01:02:01,375
Hmm…

995
01:02:08,833 --> 01:02:10,833
What? A hen-witch?

996
01:02:11,333 --> 01:02:13,750
Called Totolina? Well, it's… uh…

997
01:02:14,458 --> 01:02:15,291
Oh…

998
01:02:16,458 --> 01:02:17,291
Oh!

999
01:02:17,916 --> 01:02:19,958
It's good! Uh…

1000
01:02:20,041 --> 01:02:22,125
It's… magnificent!

1001
01:02:22,916 --> 01:02:26,583
Oh! Uh… this story could be a milestone

1002
01:02:27,083 --> 01:02:29,708
in the history of Topus Terrentus!

1003
01:02:30,416 --> 01:02:33,291
Oh! And it's mine!

1004
01:02:57,541 --> 01:02:59,708
-Hello, my dear!
-Oh!

1005
01:02:59,791 --> 01:03:01,250
Frankelda, please join us!

1006
01:03:02,541 --> 01:03:04,000
Good morning, Your Majesties.

1007
01:03:04,583 --> 01:03:06,958
Do you know how I can go back to
my realm?

1008
01:03:07,833 --> 01:03:11,083
You can't leave without first reading
Procustes's new stories.

1009
01:03:11,583 --> 01:03:13,375
Characters with desires,

1010
01:03:13,958 --> 01:03:15,791
