have done so.

1028
01:03:59,666 --> 01:04:00,500
Am I right?

1029
01:04:01,333 --> 01:04:02,166
I don't get it.

1030
01:04:04,333 --> 01:04:07,416
{\an8}Wait… what? No, no! No, no, no!

1031
01:04:07,500 --> 01:04:10,291
{\an8}He stole them while Frankelda was
dreaming!

1032
01:04:10,375 --> 01:04:13,458
{\an8}-Go to her.
-We have to fix this right now!

1033
01:04:17,583 --> 01:04:18,416
Frankelda!

1034
01:04:19,375 --> 01:04:21,041
I underestimated Procustes.

1035
01:04:21,541 --> 01:04:23,375
Forgive me, I'll fix it.

1036
01:04:23,458 --> 01:04:24,416
I'm such a fool.

1037
01:04:39,708 --> 01:04:42,375
This… is where we give up, isn't it?

1038
01:04:45,041 --> 01:04:45,875
No!

1039
01:04:49,166 --> 01:04:50,583
You stole it all!

1040
01:04:50,666 --> 01:04:53,625
You even stole- You even stole my dreams!

1041
01:04:53,708 --> 01:04:56,208
Isn't Prince Herneval the one
desperate to get your stories, by

1042
01:04:56,291 --> 01:04:58,791
